# The first shore, the Prologue's Scene 8 (#187): the end of the Prologue.
# Played by the cove's Arrival node when you come from the voyage: the Salt
# and Ember sails into the cove while this plays (about 24 seconds), and
# slows to her anchorage. You're on deck with the captain and the lantern,
# looking at the island. Then the anchor goes down, the camera pulls back,
# and the Prologue ends. Afterwards you're on deck, free, at anchor.

~ start
@fade out 0.0
@shot out_of_the_mist cut
@fade in 3.0
@wait 3.5
@place heron by_the_rail
@place lantern over_the_rail
@shot towards_the_island cut
@look lantern surprised
lantern: Oh!
@look lantern pleased
lantern: Isn't it lovely?
heron: Land at last.
lantern: Do you think they have any tomatoes?
heron: You had soup yesterday.
lantern: I liked the soup.
heron: This is it.
@face heron lantern
lantern: The island?
heron: The last mark on the chart.
@wait 1.0
heron: We've finally found it.
lantern: So... what are we looking for?
@face heron player
heron: That's what we're here to find out.
@shot the_whole_cove
@wait 4.0
@sound anchor
@wait 1.5
@shot towards_the_island cut
heron: Come along. We've got a lot to do.
@look lantern pleased
lantern: Adventure!
heron: Supplies.
lantern: Adventure and supplies!
@shot pull_back
@wait 3.0
@fade out 2.5
@title The end of the Prologue
@home heron
@home lantern
@shot free cut
@fade in 2.0
